flowchart TD
    A[Foreign State agents<br>wish to carry weapons<br>on aircraft in flight] --> B{Two conditions must be met}
    B --> C[Condition 1<br>PRIOR NOTIFICATION<br>by State of EMBARKATION<br>to State of ARRIVAL]
    B --> D[Condition 2<br>Notification of<br>PILOT-IN-COMMAND<br>of the decision]
    C --> E[Both satisfied?]
    D --> E
    E -->|YES| F[Carriage of weapon<br>PERMITTED]
    E -->|NO| G[Carriage NOT permitted]
